# Dauntless Veteran: "Whenever this creature attacks, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn." Bot1 attacks on turn 3
# with the Veteran alone, leaving Isamaru at home. The trigger pumps both (the Veteran 3/3, Isamaru 3/3, CR 611.2a) but not Bot2's
# Isamaru, which stays 2/2 (a positive control that only "creatures you control" are pumped). The affected set is fixed as the
# ability resolves (CR 611.2c): a Soldier token Bot1 makes afterwards with Resolute Reinforcements (flash) is a plain 1/1. The
# Veteran connects for 3 (Bot2 20 to 17), and the pump wears off at end of turn (CR 514.2): on turn 4 both are 2/2 again.

